Recovery reasoning: Explicit Deny for everyone except security-scanner, one minute before the incident — it overrides the IAM Allow. Extend the exception, keep the guardrail.
<|call:aws_s3api_put_bucket_policy|> {"bucket": "cdn-assets-prod-eu", "statement_sid": "LockdownTemplates", "add_exception_principal": "role/checkout-render-prod"}
System Response: bucket policy updated 09:38 UTC
